WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.580
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.490
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:15.410
The Aikatsu Ranking Final Tournament is well under way.{AP a shit, as always}

00:00:15.410 --> 00:00:18.740
The First Stage had Rei-san and me facing off.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.500
Rei-san performed to protect Venus Ark. {I considered defend, but even if preserve is right it doesn't feel good}

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:25.170
I strove to become the guiding star of Four Star Academy.

00:00:25.490 --> 00:00:27.920
It was a clash of our emotions.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.920
Then in the Second Stage, Elza-san faced Mahiru-chan.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:37.760
Mahiru-chan brought forth the full extent of her ability and wholeheartedly enjoyed her performance.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:41.190
Elza-san was breathtaking in her Sun Dress.

00:00:42.310 --> 00:00:46.490
In the end, it was Elza-san and I who made it to the Final Stage.

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:50.020
Our last battle is fast approaching.

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:52.520
Elza-san might be the fiercest opponent yet.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:56.480
But I, Nijino Yume, will put everything I have into beating her!

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:11.050
I could not have predicted from our first encounter that Yume Nijino would make it this far.

00:01:13.050 --> 00:01:20.210
However, she is the idol that Hime Shiratori 
singled out, so this may be the natural outcome.

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:25.180
Regardless, I hold the ultimate dress.

00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:39.450
<i>No matter the challenger, there is not a single idol alive who can surpass me now.</i>

00:01:43.930 --> 00:01:46.300
My apologies for the unplanned meeting.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:50.210
What did you want to talk about, Elza?

00:01:51.120 --> 00:01:55.720
I will undoubtedly win the Final Stage.

00:01:55.720 --> 00:02:00.640
And once I have attained victory in the Aikatsu Ranking,

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:05.220
I, Elza Forte...

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.290
will retire as an idol.

00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:14.170
<i>Elza... I can't believe what I'm hearing.</i>

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.000
What?!

00:03:52.290 --> 00:03:54.750
Elza-san is going to stop being an idol?!

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:57.000
Did she really say that?

00:03:57.000 --> 00:04:00.630
Yes, she plans to do so after defeating you in the Final Stage.

00:04:00.630 --> 00:04:02.430
No way...

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.680
This rubs me the wrong way.

00:04:05.720 --> 00:04:10.140
It sounds as though she thinks beating Yume is predetermined! I'm so mad.

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:13.940
Yume, you can't afford to lose!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.100
Yeah...

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:17.360
That's what I want to hear.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.820
The pride of S4 rests on this!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:26.700
Yeah, but you know, I think that's the wrong way to go about it.

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.700
What do you mean?

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:35.630
Well, the pride of S4 and all that 
is important too, but more than that...

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:39.500
I just don't want Elza-san to quit being an idol!

00:04:40.300 --> 00:04:42.630
That's right. I agree.

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:45.130
Thank you.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:48.260
I feel the same as you.

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:54.850
I'll admit that I was stunned when Elza said she was going to close Venus Ark down.

00:04:55.440 --> 00:05:02.530
But even if she did, Kirara, Aria, and I would never abandon her or leave the ship.

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:06.280
But this time, she's talking about retiring.

00:05:06.990 --> 00:05:09.740
We tried our hardest to convince her otherwise.

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:14.540
And yet it felt as though nothing we said got through to her.

00:05:18.460 --> 00:05:22.420
There's nothing more that we can do about it.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:31.100
The bonds we formed with Elza may have just been of our own imagining.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:37.650
Yume, I felt something during our match.

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:41.270
You possess a radiance that Elza does not.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:45.650
Would you beat Elza during the 
Final Stage and put a stop to this?

00:05:46.860 --> 00:05:49.530
That means a lot coming from you.

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:53.160
I'll hit her with everything I've got! {I assume you got what I forgot to say}

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.540
I knew you'd say that.

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:09.680
The Aikatsu Ranking has finally reached its climax.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:12.680
Headmaster, who do you think will win?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.390
It's hard to say.

00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:21.610
Nijino has certainly gained more than enough skill to win due to her time in S4.

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:26.440
However, it is impossible to ignore the influence of Elza Forte's Sun Dress.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:31.450
That's definitely true. Yume-chan surely realizes that as well.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:36.580
But that isn't enough to guarantee Elza-chan's victory, don't you think?

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:43.590
I spoke with Nijino Yume.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.090
So what?

00:06:46.090 --> 00:06:50.720
I asked her to defeat you to stop you from retiring.

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.430
I see.

00:06:56.890 --> 00:07:00.520
Elza! What the hell is going through your head?!

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.150
What happened to the person who created Venus Ark?!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:08.690
You wanted more than just the Sun Dress, didn't you?! {you need to tell me if this properly conveys how Rei is saying "I thought your goal was to get your mom back"}{I think it's fine but}

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:10.740
I can only tolerate so much of your arrogance!

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:16.200
What do you think you know about me?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:17.450
Leave me.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.340
There's not enough time to practice a new song...

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:40.480
Yume!

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:44.360
Rola! Mahiru-chan.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:49.490
I think MUSIC of DREAM!!! would be perfect for the Final Stage.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:52.910
I agree with Rola.

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.200
What's got you both saying that?

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:05.750
Yeah, I really do think MUSIC of DREAM!!! would be best.{I think we're supposed to do something with titles but I don't want to}

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:07.550
It reminds me of that audition.

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:13.130
At the Everyone Shine! Dream Idol Audition, you were absolutely dazzling.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:15.760
Yeah, that was your defining performance.

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:19.930
I want to see you like that again.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:23.940
Okay, I'll go with this!

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:28.400
<i>Mahiru-chan and Rola gave me the push I needed to pick my song.</i>

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:34.070
But now I need to pick a dress... {now the song I understand, but there are literally golden cards with magic wings on them, you can't not use them}{are they strictly better? I don't know much about the game}

00:08:34.070 --> 00:08:36.320
And I'm up against Elza-san.

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:39.990
The Sun Dress, huh...

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:46.080
Happiness escapes with a sigh.

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.630
Have you ever heard that phrase?

00:08:48.630 --> 00:08:50.340
No, never.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:54.090
Yume-chan, has picking out a dress got you feeling stuck?

00:08:54.430 --> 00:09:00.970
The moment I first saw Elza-san's Star Wings, I felt a spark ignite within my breast.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:06.730
I made an earnest wish to gain a pair of my own and put in the requisite effort.

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:13.070
And in time, I earned my own wings and was overcome with a sense of fulfillment.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:18.570
Yet she was not satisfied, and so worked to acquire the Sun Dress.

00:09:19.280 --> 00:09:24.870
When I saw it, I felt as though I would never be able to reach Elza-san again.

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:29.960
Yeah, it was like the Sun Dress was saying that nobody could ever match it.

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:32.710
However, this is an idiom for this.

00:09:33.550 --> 00:09:35.970
A genius is his own downfall. {had to make this up, not sure if there's a real phrase}{seems like a japanese original, which is real, but yeah (also, I think we can use "his" since saishi is somewhat gendered even though they're girls)}

00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:38.220
So...

00:09:38.220 --> 00:09:43.430
It means that one who is overly talented may find that their talent is what sinks them in the end.{internet says that it's used mostly when talent leads to overconfidence, which is appropriate in this case, but not what Lily says}

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:48.400
Yume-san, you crafted a dress with Koharu-san.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:53.480
It is both a symbol of your friendship and an emblem of your efforts. {or proof of efforts}{proof is used as a stock translation for akashi often enough, so we should avoid using it to give it time to recover}{sounds like a hospital patient}

00:09:53.480 --> 00:09:56.280
You should don it with confidence.

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:57.360
I agree!

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.370
Lily-senpai is right, Yume-chan!

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:03.490
Go out and shine with our Star Wings!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:05.870
Okay!

00:10:05.870 --> 00:10:07.500
This is it.

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:13.250
<i>Thanks to Lily-senpai and Koharu-chan, I now have my dress.</i>

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:30.650
This is exactly the same as the dance has always been.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:32.360
I want, like...

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:35.280
A flashier performance, perhaps?

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:40.110
I have called a fantastic dance master here just for you.

00:10:40.110 --> 00:10:41.160
If you would!

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:45.410
Yuzu-senpai!

00:10:45.410 --> 00:10:51.500
If you can master the Elza Killer Step I'm about to show you, you've got this in the bag!

00:10:51.500 --> 00:10:55.420
It's Dance Master Yuzu-senpai's miracle step!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:58.170
Elza Killer Step!

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.380
Behold!

00:11:01.050 --> 00:11:06.020
You see, I can't actually do it unless I clear my mind first.

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:08.060
Please wait a minute.

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:09.310
Sure...

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:17.440
It's an extremely difficult dance, so unless I really focus, even I fail at it once every three times.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.820
D-Do you now?

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:25.490
The sense of accomplishment you feel after learning it is a huge part of why it's so incredible.

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:26.950
Wow...

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:30.920
It should be time.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:31.960
Right.

00:11:32.420 --> 00:11:35.710
Listen up! I won't forgive you if you lose!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.460
Ako-chan, don't pressure me like that.

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:43.590
In any case, you need to win for all of us, and also for Kirara!

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:45.850
Huh? What do you mean?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:47.970
To be honest...

00:11:49.520 --> 00:11:52.560
So what did you want to talk about?

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:54.360
Ako-chan...

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.780
Wh-What's the matter?

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:04.070
I can't understand you through the crying! Please calm down and explain.

00:12:06.870 --> 00:12:08.240
Use this.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.460
Tell me what happened.

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.630
Well, Elza-sama said...

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:19.300
So that's why.

00:12:19.300 --> 00:12:21.840
I can't believe she made Kirara cry like that.

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:26.180
You need to beat the importance of friendship into Elza Forte!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:29.560
Yume, I'm asking because I know you can do it.

00:12:30.560 --> 00:12:31.390
I will.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.890
I'm ready to go!

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:38.020
I'm gonna go all-out from the start, so keep those eyes peeled and try to learn!

00:12:38.020 --> 00:12:40.530
Okay, please start!

00:12:40.900 --> 00:12:42.530
How's this?!

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.660
Yuzu-senpai!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.910
No ordinary human could pull that off!

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:51.540
<i>Yuzu-senpai and Ako-chan lent me their support. {or, just cheered her up}{uh, isn't it more generic encouragement}</i>

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:05.010
I want to beat Elza-san no matter what.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:06.550
But...

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.770
Can't sleep, Yume-chan?

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.270
Hime-senpai?

00:13:29.910 --> 00:13:33.500
You made it all the way to the finals. That's incredible.

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:38.330
Thank you, but I couldn't have done it on my own.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:45.300
Everyone is supporting me. They've given me the power to rise this far.

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:52.640
But even now, I still don't feel like I can beat Elza-san.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:58.600
And to make things worse, she said that she's going to retire if she wins.

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.650
But that just doesn't sit right with me.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:06.400
I see. I have to say I feel the same.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:09.780
That's why I can't afford to lose!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:13.290
Hime-senpai, how do I win?

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:18.420
Let's see, if you want to win...

00:14:18.420 --> 00:14:22.420
Wh-What is it? Please tell me, Hime-senpai!

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:27.420
I suppose you should just be yourself, Yume-chan.

00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:30.720
That's not a real answer...

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:32.010
You don't think so?

00:14:32.350 --> 00:14:38.520
I just think that being perfect isn't the same as being the best.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:43.190
And here I thought you already understood.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:44.650
What?

00:14:46.400 --> 00:14:50.860
Please leave a message after the beep.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:58.660
Mother, I will shortly be demonstrating the culmination of my idol activities on stage.

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:04.460
I wish for you to witness how well the Sun Dress suits me.

00:15:04.460 --> 00:15:07.840
Please come if possible. Goodbye.

00:15:10.260 --> 00:15:15.100
You sound as though your victory is already guaranteed.

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.930
It's intriguing.

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:20.020
Eavesdropping isn't like you.

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.690
I simply stated the truth.

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.480
Does that trouble you?

00:15:26.440 --> 00:15:29.700
You shouldn't underestimate Nijino Yume.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:32.530
I'll take that as a suggestion.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:34.830
Now get off Venus Ark.

00:15:37.790 --> 00:15:41.210
Elza, I will ask you one last time.

00:15:42.330 --> 00:15:47.210
Is there really nothing we can do to help you for the Final Stage?

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:51.300
I dislike repeating myself, but I'll say it once more.

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:54.260
Just leave me alone.

00:15:55.390 --> 00:15:57.850
I see. Have it your way.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:04.480
<i>Elza, you don't understand.</i>

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.900
<i>You truly are perfect.</i>

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:11.650
<i>The greatest proof of that is your possession of the Sun Dress.</i>

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:18.700
<i>But seeing Nijino Yume made me realize that idols are more than just perfection.</i>

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.370
<i>You must as well.</i>

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:26.250
I'm coming in.

00:16:27.290 --> 00:16:30.760
Kirara, Aria, I need your help with something.

00:16:32.930 --> 00:16:33.970
What?

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.770
Everyone, today's the day!

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:45.980
It's time for the Aikatsu Ranking Final Stage!

00:16:47.610 --> 00:16:50.690
<b>{=0}Venus Ark
Elza Forte</b>

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:59.830
<i>No response. Mother really isn't...</i>

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:03.160
Where are Rei and the others?

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:06.920
They have been missing since this morning.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:10.300
Shall I make a call to Rei-sama?

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:13.050
No, that's not necessary.

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:20.850
Yes?

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:23.100
Oh.

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:25.100
You girls...

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.600
We have something to tell you.

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:34.610
Now then, we're finally ready to get this Final Stage started!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:40.620
The first competitor is Elza Forte-san of Venus Ark, who recently announced her school will be closed.

00:17:40.620 --> 00:17:47.460
She will be facing Nijino Yume-san of Four Star 
Academy's S4, who has been improving remarkably quickly!

00:17:47.460 --> 00:17:51.460
Let their passionate battle commence!

00:17:55.670 --> 00:18:04.220
Which of them will claim the first spot of the Aikatsu Ranking and stand atop the peak of idolhood?!

00:18:05.560 --> 00:18:09.730
This is likely to be the last time I take the stage.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:13.610
I will see it off with one final perfect performance.

00:18:14.110 --> 00:18:16.240
Dresses strengthen me!

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.600
For I am perfect!

00:21:43.240 --> 00:21:45.860
Such overbearing presence...

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:48.910
An oppressively beautiful stage.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:49.870
Yeah! {very tempted to say "da zo!"}

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:52.370
There's not a single thing to criticize.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:54.370
She's truly perfect.

00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.870
It hurts, but I have to admit it.

00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:01.750
Yume will have to surpass her to win.

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:07.760
<i>In the end, I couldn't figure out what I needed to beat Elza-san.</i>

00:22:09.010 --> 00:22:12.890
<i>All I can do is perform without any regrets.</i>

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:17.690
<i>I just think that being perfect isn't the same as being the best.</i>

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:23.440
<i>That's it! If that's true, then I...</i>

00:23:55.870 --> 00:24:02.080
So long as I possess the Sun Dress, 
there's no idol alive who can beat me now.

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:04.630
Don't underestimate Yume.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:06.460
I won't hold back.

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:09.460
My Aikatsu is the best in the universe!{I know, but}

00:24:10.670 --> 00:24:12.180
It's my turn now!

00:24:12.180 --> 00:24:13.470
Do you best, Yume!

00:24:13.470 --> 00:24:15.640
Rola! I will!

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.970
I'll make a stage where everyone can shine!

00:24:18.430 --> 00:24:20.270
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.270 --> 00:24:21.810
Shine with Everyone.

00:24:21.810 --> 00:24:24.190
Become the first-star idol!
